      "mergeID": "65dcd0053e84adf7d572f29c",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Since \"Report/Environment\" and \"General/Environment\" have been merged into [string 25309 \"Environment\"](https://crowdin.com/editor/vrchat-application/19/en-fr?view=comfortable#25309), this string is now being used for two separate contexts. One for **reporting a toxic social environment**, and another for **masking the world environment in the camera**.\n\nA new string should be created to account for being able to translate these two contexts separately.\n\n(This would also require removing either the reporting or camera context from the existing string depending on which one the new string is created for.)",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Create new \"Environment\" string to accommodate for string merge ID #25083",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "65ccebae2f19744dd8f0c25e",
      "private": false,
